<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has intensified airstrikes, bombing a Karen village, damaging homes and vehicles, and attacking two naval vessels on the Kaladan River, which were reported sunk. Thai troops fired warning shots after cross-border fighting damaged 20 Thai homes, and Thai border villagers protested stray artillery shells fired from Myanmar. The regime imprisoned two Islamic teachers, seized a historic mosque, and four people were charged over a Molotov attack on a Myanmar refugee settlement, while an ASEAN envoy prepares to visit. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPUnJZVlF5Nk44MkpjQUJveHZZczFuQWpndnlXdXgtZkhLem0wQ09vVmV4RVFYN1BYZzN6bFF3RS0zaDk1MjU0eENDYjVURTlKbEJzS2hlR3o1S3VUT2lCYWxrOEMwN043bVRkRV96N3dReURvQUlScW44bU9ZYTB1RXVIdC14WmVJaHZVLV9ueFplUTVaSDN4NEMyaGo?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNSWl4SlBja1R4RkhhaTMxemplMld0aldQMmlzbzdsOVlPMnJFWVNwRVVMa1dnanFtOVctTlEyWjl0SnI4Q3I4TzQ4QU5LRjRtX3BKSXc2RE5tQTNRSWhKYXlvX01QdE1OZWlQc1d4ZkZwWWxVQTVGLUR1NWFVWjZYcFNvNDJXS1hOYXUtVWRQSkdwMVZ5MGtUcHpjUTI3TjZ6M0VZaUdhLVdSTzA5UXkyYXlWUTFyRHlXb0tF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOYktYVUNmVi1wMkQ4NlRYWnRGYTYxajR1YVNlUnp4ZC00R05wQ0RmekxJa01Idi02VWRRMEFIelJjdTNVRk5YMHZWV25sSTVnUkRaOEZsRER6dGFLUnJWc093d1RBUGtMTGYwRGRhOHVoQXExdURTRi16VURHeVNRc2oxQUZYTl9STVRPZURfZWhjWTdoeDNzRmVKMkdGanlMMlN4eQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Karen News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GMA Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxObS1Vd3o2UDZZMHpFa3pHWE5QZHh6bjF4alpOdWtsTHBUdGdtLWRJ